resh  fish and squid in particular it has an  awful smell and they were covering  everything but yeah it'll be interesting  to see how this came about his event the  usher in world peace or to end the  nuclear holocaust that involved a squid  but how that transformed in the squid  falling from the sky like raining down  isn't exactly clear I wonder what people  think her and I don't mind really a big  fan of comic book movies and I wonder if  what fans of those think like was this  comic book II enough maybe too much  maybe not enough I thought it was pretty  cool like I thought that it had a  feeling of that in particular like  inside the police station and when we  saw her getting ready getting into  costume and then the way that she drove  around it was these little details that  kind of fit in and augmented things  rather than making it really like  cartoonish overall I thought the action  was pretty slick it didn't seem overdone  it was really well directed like I said  I think Nicole Castle did a really good  job with it  and there were also some comedy nugget  stas in there as well there was quite a  few things that put a smile on my face  or made me chuckle under my breath so it  was pretty well rounded and it pretty  much delivered a feeling similar to what  I got when I read the original story so  it'll be interesting to see what fans of  the original thought of it what people  who never read it think about it and if  you want more details about things I  made it several trailer breakdowns where  I went pretty deep on the different  imagery that we see so you can pick that  up there but there is so much here that  I just can't go into it in this video so  please like this video if you enjoyed it  please subscribe to my channel I want to  do quite a few videos weekly on this  because it's gonna be a great ride as  far as I can tell  let me know in the comments what you  thought what you hope to see in the next  couple of weeks how you're hoping to see  things play out if you got questions  about the original I can answer those  for you if you have theories I'd love to  hear them  for watching I will talk to you soon
 

